    find: "  if(_saveBusy){\n    const lbl=esc(APPN_LBL[mySlug()]||mySlug())+' FY'+(MS.cur%100);\n    if(!quiet) setStat('⏳ The shared folder’s copy of '+lbl+' was <b>not loaded</b>",
